  (section
    (heading "Overview")
    (para "Implement **complete 48-test interoperability suite** to verify cross-language compatibility.")
    (para "**Test Matrix (N² for N languages):**")
    (item "Python → Python (4 combinations)")
    (item "Python → Swift (4 combinations)")
    (item "Swift → Python (4 combinations)")
    (item "Swift → Swift (4 combinations)")
    (para "**Test Layers (12 scenarios per combination):**")
    (item "1. **Transport Layer** (5 scenarios): Simple, empty, large, multiple, invalid key")
    (item "2. **Protocol 0 (Text)** (3 scenarios): JSON, large JSON, invalid JSON")
    (item "3. **Protocol 1 (Binary)** (4 scenarios): Base, compressed, encrypted, both")
    (para "**Total Tests:** 4 combinations × 12 scenarios = **48 tests**")
    (para "**Critical Requirement:** ALL 48 tests MUST pass. No exceptions. Wire format compatibility alone is NOT sufficient - actual UDP network communication must work."))
  (section
    (heading "What This Step Builds")
    (para "Implements the interoperability test suite — the 48-test matrix validating Python↔Python, Python↔Swift, Swift↔Python, Swift↔Swift communication across all protocol layers with real UDP sockets."))
